                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "0244c818-b0df-32a9-8519-1eb558c043f2",
                        "entry_id": "ec246e37-b314-3b6c-965d-2a537ae2ba2e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Gier nach wertvollem Dingen, hauptsächlich Geld"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "846ce474-fcd0-4e08-965d-646675e506e2",
                                "sense_id": "0244c818-b0df-32a9-8519-1eb558c043f2",
                                "text": "„Der alte A. ist tatsächlich out und tabu, dafür hat der Holocaust gesorgt. Die Wahnstruktur: Der Jude als solcher ist böse, deshalb gehört er weg – vertrieben oder umgebracht. Er mordet Christenmädchen, um deren Blut in seiner Matze zu verarbeiten, dem ungesäuerten Brot. Seine Markenzeichen sind Raffgier, Betrug und Wucher, seine Mittel sind Verschwörung und Zersetzung.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c5986571-a1a1-46c5-a8aa-108b1b2c8397",
                                "sense_id": "0244c818-b0df-32a9-8519-1eb558c043f2",
                                "text": "„Da war dieses Land nicht mehr unser Land. Und jetzt, als müsste das Schlimmste zum Schluss kommen, reißt die Raffgier der Wall-Street-Banker die Finanzmärkte in die Tiefe, in einem Tempo, das schwindeln lässt und tief sitzende Ängste vor einer Wiederkehr der Weltwirtschaftskrise von 1929 weckt. So war die Stimmungslage, als Peer Steinbrück vergangene Woche ans Rednerpult des Bundestages trat.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0b6a80e9-ebd7-43a0-8287-bea07de6745a",
                                "sense_id": "0244c818-b0df-32a9-8519-1eb558c043f2",
                                "text": "„In der persönlichen Praxis schätzt er Scheidung mindestens so wie Ehe, Döner wie Burger - und eine ernsthafte Patriotismus-Debatte verhindert spätestens die Raffgier eines prominenten Parteifreundes. (Quelle: fr-aktuell.de vom 08.01.2005)“"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "80216290-1208-44cd-9204-c9d18a834939",
                        "source_entry_id": "ec246e37-b314-3b6c-965d-2a537ae2ba2e",
                        "source_sense_id": "0244c818-b0df-32a9-8519-1eb558c043f2",
                        "source_sense_description": "Gier nach wertvollem Dingen, hauptsächlich Geld",
                        "target_lang_word": "greed",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "greed",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8bff3a12-6956-38c5-9db7-39123cafa205",
                                        "entry_id": "55171cf4-41ee-31f1-9eaa-90671c1faec9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A selfish or excessive desire for more than is needed or deserved, especially of money, wealth, food, or other possessions."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9830e570-5c1d-4e67-a317-8fd1cee96526",
                                                "sense_id": "8bff3a12-6956-38c5-9db7-39123cafa205",
                                                "text": "His greed was his undoing."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9998a4c5-5551-4fed-990c-e7cd09736564",
                                                "sense_id": "8bff3a12-6956-38c5-9db7-39123cafa205",
                                                "text": "[…]But when I had bestridden the plank, quoth I to myself, \"Thou deserveth all that betideth thee. All this is decreed to me of Allah (whose name be exalted!), to turn me from my greed of gain, whence ariseth all that I endure, for I have wealth galore.\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "090ab8ff-1782-428a-8903-372d23ae4873",
                                                "sense_id": "8bff3a12-6956-38c5-9db7-39123cafa205",
                                                "text": "Your market gardener is not a well-breeched man, dependant as he is on the imponderables of glut, the inequities of distribution, and the greeds of wholesaler and retailer."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "da05c7f1-cd52-47e9-95d3-7e40241c412f",
                                                "sense_id": "8bff3a12-6956-38c5-9db7-39123cafa205",
                                                "text": "She does not display voracities and greeds like a number of patients […] nor has she shown any significant tendency to possessiveness, grievance, paranoia, or mania."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e472d04f-fceb-4cd9-8cc5-a17da0d738e1",
                                                "sense_id": "8bff3a12-6956-38c5-9db7-39123cafa205",
                                                "text": "The point is, ladies and gentleman, that greed, for lack of a better word, is good. Greed is right, greed works. Greed clarifies, cuts through, and captures the essence of the evolutionary spirit. Greed, in all of its forms; greed for life, for money, for love, knowledge has marked the upward surge of mankind."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "greed",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ec41933d-5820-3913-b821-23406d83c31e",
                                        "entry_id": "0cc97faf-bca1-385b-82df-ecd5dd0fbb81",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To desire in a greedy manner, or to act on such a desire."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f8670af7-9cad-404b-8633-d597266d1af5",
                                                "sense_id": "ec41933d-5820-3913-b821-23406d83c31e",
                                                "text": "The ravens sit greeding, / And watching, and heeding: / Thoro' wind, over water, / Comes scent of the slaughter, / And ravens sit greeding / Their share of the bones."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b0808650-caae-47d5-bdb8-af9168706414",
                                                "sense_id": "ec41933d-5820-3913-b821-23406d83c31e",
                                                "text": "Hearing these words he arose, because indeed he greeded for her, and came up behind her as she rested upon her elbows and knees and bending in hand his prickle nailed it into her coynte and did manly devoir."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "de2fb649-fa3f-42e7-8e14-1be5d6d1a96a",
                                                "sense_id": "ec41933d-5820-3913-b821-23406d83c31e",
                                                "text": "This conniving bastard has greeded the farm off an old man and I end up with nothing."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "ae970069-08d7-422b-a722-00fd9b8b405d",
                        "source_entry_id": "ec246e37-b314-3b6c-965d-2a537ae2ba2e",
                        "source_sense_id": "0244c818-b0df-32a9-8519-1eb558c043f2",
                        "source_sense_description": "Gier nach wertvollem Dingen, hauptsächlich Geld",
                        "target_lang_word": "rapacity",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "rapacity",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c14c969d-ba93-340b-9f60-c676ed6bf4e9",
                                        "entry_id": "a97d5a8d-edfe-3a7d-876e-0f7839c5ba48",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The quality of being rapacious; voracity."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "acf87b93-e3b1-4a3e-8cc1-c7c62d36d2ec",
                                                "sense_id": "c14c969d-ba93-340b-9f60-c676ed6bf4e9",
                                                "text": "Animals of the hare kind, like all others that feed entirely upon vegetables, are inoffenſive and timorous. As Nature furniſhes them vvith a moſt abundant ſupply, they have not that rapacity after food remarkable in ſuch as are often ſtinted in their proviſion."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5accfb61-d25b-442e-8288-082868a758d4",
                                                "sense_id": "c14c969d-ba93-340b-9f60-c676ed6bf4e9",
                                                "text": "A taint of imbecile rapacity blew through it all, like a whiff from some corpse."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "c45ac11c-dfb6-4d5e-bcbd-e9cbdf49df9f",
                        "source_entry_id": "ec246e37-b314-3b6c-965d-2a537ae2ba2e",
